  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-12-03T19:37:09.575Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So, i've moved, and now i have a very bad internet, and every time i join a world, it is impossible to play until every single avatar is loaded, with ping values over 5k... The same happens every time someone changes avatar, pings goes through the roof, and game becomes unplayable until they finish loading... Now, some people might not be affected by people loading new avatars, but for someone who has 10 mbits connection (standard adsl connection), its really harsh to play.\n\nThanks, and please continue your good work, Merry Christmas <3",
